mission "The Sound Beneath the Soundings"
    name "The Sound Beneath the Soundings"
    description "Test the observatory's theory at a stretch of water where the lead line rings like a struck glass."
    source "Port Azure"
    destination "Bellweather Cay"
    reward 940
    speaker offer "Keeper Orlan"
    speaker visit "Keeper Orlan"
    speaker complete "Keeper Orlan"
    to offer
        has "A Scholar Without a Flag: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Keeper Orlan's lead line has been brought back from the test waters. The glass bead at its end is scored, and the sounding notes show an impossible change in depth.`
            `Orlan holds the lead line out for you to inspect. "At one stretch it rings like struck glass. That is no ordinary reef or shoal. The observatory's theory is that something beneath the seabed is changing the sound."`
            choice
                `"If there is a truth to find, I will help find it."`
                    accept
                `"What does this have to do with the old expedition?"`
                    goto details
                `"I will not chase a secret on promises alone."`
                    close
            label details
                `Orlan marks a narrow patch of water on the chart. "Take the sounding carefully. If the old expedition used this passage, the bottom may explain why its charts were altered."`
                choice
                    `"Very well. Let us bring this into the open."`
                        accept
                    `"I have heard enough. I must be on my way."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Sound Beneath the Soundings. Test the observatory's theory at a stretch of water where the lead line rings like a struck glass."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At Bellweather Cay, Orlan compares your soundings with the observatory's old measurements. The notes fit the hidden route. "The expedition was not hunting gold alone," Orlan says. "It was looking for a place the official charts have been made to forget."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Orlan coils the lead line and sets it beside the chart. "We have a place to search, not a final answer. Still, the sea has given up one secret. We should be careful who gets to write the next chart."`
        log "Completed The Sound Beneath the Soundings. Received 940 gold. Test the observatory's theory at a stretch of water where the lead line rings like a struck glass."
